# Private boundary for vault search.
# Anything matched here is never indexed, never returned by search or ask,
# and cannot be fetched through the vault_read tool.
#
# A name without a slash matches a file or folder of that name at any depth:
#   journal
#   *.private.md
# A path with a slash is anchored at the vault root and covers everything below:
#   personal/medical
#   work/clients/*
#
# Atoms tagged `private`, `status/private` or `status/sensitive` are excluded
# wherever they live. Change that list with the VSEARCH_EXCLUDE_TAGS variable.
#
# /seed writes your real private folders below this line.
